<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has built a 90km network of military roads in southern Lebanon, including one in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, and opened new bases, while Hezbollah continues artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Israeli strikes have wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65-year-old retired engineer. Protests against Israeli attacks on Palestine and Lebanon have taken place in Sweden. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and there were 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQX3NWc1ZHUnlVclVhN21TRlFqbzhlcTNSc3Q5M0t3b3l2VE5MTnNIT3JjdGF2bE5BRnRnUHNySElmT21CMDlQcTlyTnRldEZsUWhpajg5SEd3VnhaWnM2M1ZPRXRyQlNTMTN0a2l5THlfaFBDTEppbXF6cUJOZkNSSUtWZzNPVzBhaU5vSV83QWFJelFNOTR5Yk1yWUxDRlM4dl9PN3JnZkR2b0NJazR3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/israel-eisenkot-officially-tasked-with-forming-a-government/a-79891422&quot;&gt;dw.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPMDQ5STF5dnAyb1daZjJhNGx3ZUYtNm5fR2xBeHJKMTU2NlhmY1lqSWtZQTV6OHhzZXozYzltQ2owTFk0Ykd3bTZaN0RpSVYwUDQtUlFiYU5KS0tNaDZsVWc3ZXFUbVFfSDVvZ2Z1cDRqLU5ldktNRlY2Wk1xbjA5S0JoTm9QYW5VaTVkdXRnSzNONmRiRTAybXJCdFlJLWFmRGlLMjJNeHpWNUZpUVBhWklfZUp6Xzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al-Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFAtUVA5NU5xWXYyc3BNUExDUmQ1MGlpRmxSSngxdUk5SnpJV1hnT3hWRnRtaUgtOWtRRWJKR0pJSC1qOXF6Yjg5UXpoMUZjTDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mu